  "description": "Delete targets and a held cursor. A dynaset on T is positioned on ID 2, then DELETE FROM T WHERE ID = 2 runs with dbFailOnError; asks the cursor's current-row read, MoveNext and MovePrevious afterwards. Then DELETE C.* FROM P INNER JOIN C ... WHERE P.Name = 'p1'; DELETE P.* FROM P INNER JOIN C (P3 still has a restricting child); and DELETE FROM T2 with no predicate, followed by T2's RecordCount, indexes and W ValidationRule. Asks the return, RecordsAffected, Errors and rows of each.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
